<title>USA: Muni ylds hit new two-year low vs long Treasuries.</title>
<headline>Muni ylds hit new two-year low vs long Treasuries.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Triple-A, 30-year municipal bonds yielded 79.0 percent of 30-year U.S. Treasuries as of Tuesday's close, the lowest level in more than two years, Delphis Hanover Corp said.</p>
<p>Tuesday's ratio was the lowest since March 7, 1995, when munis were yielding 78.6 percent of long Treasuries, a Delphis analyst said.</p>
<p>((--Kathie O'Donnell, 212-859-1655))</p>
